# OmRate-AgentOps — Cursor rules index

Read this file first when working in this repository.

## What this repo is

Control plane for OmRate **validation orchestration**: manifests, protocol rules, known gaps, reports, and runbooks. Not the application backend or frontend.

## Where to look

| Area | Path |
| ---- | ---- |
| Overview | `README.md`, `CLAUDE.md` |
| Manifests | `manifests/` |
| Protocol rules | `protocol-rules/` |
| Known gaps | `known-gaps/` |
| Reports | `reports/` |
| Runbooks | `runbooks/` |
| Tests | `tests/` |
| Python project | `pyproject.toml` |
| Env template | `.env.example` |

## Sibling repos (outside this tree)

- `../OmRate-Backend`
- `../OmRate-frontend`
- `../Phalanx-Skill`

Do not assume sibling code is present; reference paths are for documentation and cross-repo workflows.
